 "address": "Gustav Mahlerlaan 7-27 / Rosy Wertheimstraat, Zuidas: 2020 pand of two blocks, the nine-storey GUSTAV on Gustav Mahlerlaan in pale grey textured brick with concrete ledges at every floor line, punched windows and louvres, a full-height glazed stair core and a dark glazed plinth, and a stepped eight-storey block behind it wrapped in continuous cantilever slab balconies with glass balustrades, terracing down to the west (kit batch 2005+, lane kit-batch-2005-20261121)",
